sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Runner
    participant E as Environment
    participant A as Agent
    participant G as ToolGateway
    participant T as Tool
    participant V as Evaluators
    R->>E: prepare(case) [fresh store]
    E->>A: RunContext(gateway, events, limits)
    A->>G: tool_call(name, args)
    G->>G: permission → validation → fault → retry
    G->>T: handler(args)
    T-->>G: value / error
    G-->>A: observation
    A-->>R: AgentResult (trajectory, answer, failure_class)
    R->>V: evaluate(case, result) per evaluator (isolated)
    V-->>R: EvaluationResult[]
    R->>R: verdict + metrics + events export (redacted)
